                <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[44px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">How Long Does It Take to Go From 0 to 700 Credit? Real Timeline</h1>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-7 text-slate-500 max-w-[640px]">Starting from no credit file? Most Americans hit 700 in <b class="text-slate-900">12-18 months</b> with two reporting accounts and perfect payment history. Here's the month-by-month reality, backed by Experian data.</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
