                    <div class="mt-2 text-[20px] md:text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight">0 → 700 in 12-18 months is realistic — if you do this:</div>
                    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-[14px] leading-6 text-slate-300">
                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> <span>Open <b class="text-white">1 secured card / Chime Secured + 1 credit-builder installment</b> (Self). You need 2 account types for best mix.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> <span><b class="text-white">100% on-time payments</b> – 35% of your FICO. One 30-day late can drop score 60-100 points per CFPB.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> <span>Keep utilization <b class="text-white">&lt;10%</b> on the revolving account. Report $5-$20, then pay in full.</span></li>
                        <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> <span>Experian: Average user goes from no score to 677 within 12 months of first account opening.</span></li>
